    "message": "chore(ci): a temporary dispatch so client.yml compiles this branch\n\nThe macOS and iOS jobs of client.yml run only on a pull request or an explicit\ndispatch, and this machine has neither a token nor `gh`. This one-file workflow\nturns a push to its probe branch into that dispatch, as `probe-dispatch.yml`\ndoes for the source-refused probe. It lives on the probe branch alone and is\ndeleted with it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
